+{$PACKRECORDS 1}
+
+{ FleetRecord.OrderData is 6 bytes: ORDERS.PAS's SetFleetCode/GetFleetCode copy a whole
+  OrderStructure (a Word and a pointer) through it, which fits only with 4-byte pointers, as Turbo
+  Pascal's real-mode far pointers were. A 64-bit target would silently overwrite the fields after it.
+  The harness builds compile with -Pi386; this stops any build that doesn't. }
+{$IF SizeOf(Pointer)<>4}
+{$FATAL The Anacreon harness needs a 32-bit target (fpc -Pi386): FleetRecord.OrderData holds a 4-byte pointer.}
+{$ENDIF}
